    "detailed_description": "<strong>H.O.G.S</strong> is an immersive fps where you play as a pig cop in a dystopian England ruled by pigs. You are a one-hog army sent to crush the insurgent groups that have emerged within the district of <strong>Runt's Litter</strong>. Engage enemies in fast-paced combat where the difference between life and death is a well-placed bullet, an object to the head, or a boot to the face.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/56b2f24d0157de49e42f6fa94cbb673b.avif?t=1723061784\" width=120 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/07d28aa5ff5864f59a2477cdc2f001a0.poster.avif?t=1723061784\" width=360 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/07d28aa5ff5864f59a2477cdc2f001a0.webm?t=1723061784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Throw objects, kick down doors or smash windows and flank from behind. <strong>Use the environment to your advantage.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Clever enemies</strong> use tables as cover, throw objects and hunt the player. You better get smart or get killed.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/56b2f24d0157de49e42f6fa94cbb673b.avif?t=1723061784\" width=120 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/381bd2809ddcc680c7e3d76cadbfa5c0.poster.avif?t=1723061784\" width=360 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/381bd2809ddcc680c7e3d76cadbfa5c0.webm?t=1723061784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore the dark reality of a Post-Singularist England ruled by pigs in a <strong>story told through environmental details and context clues</strong>.<br></li><li> <strong>Levels are non-linear</strong>, featuring multiple paths to choose from when engaging the enemy. Will you sneak in from behind enemy lines or go guns-a-blazing through the front door.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/56b2f24d0157de49e42f6fa94cbb673b.avif?t=1723061784\" width=120 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/faf42b9a624054088e6cc4246c6156b9.poster.avif?t=1723061784\" width=360 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899270/extras/faf42b9a624054088e6cc4246c6156b9.webm?t=1723061784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Endless replayability</strong>; score mode, speedrun challenges and three achievements per level let you enjoy H.O.G.S for as long as you wish.<br></li><li> <strong>Compete with other players</strong> to get the best score or time on global breadboards. Will you be the best in the world? </li></ul>",
